{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4bf9c613cdee87ef2f8e776ee349a3685a025471abc3acf2e6a5f58277f0870e", "ja": "歩、こんなところにいたのか。\n盛り上がっているところ悪いんだけど、話があるんだ。", "zh": "步，原来你在这里。\n抱歉在你们聊得正起劲的时候打扰，但我有事跟你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "63f037a02c8124d66c510b6dd0efe66cb2b384376bd4402def29a1f398ca4c00", "ja": "{$P$}？\n話って何？", "zh": "{$P$}？\n有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1002_p", "source_sha256": "caf8b5809290b3df11c6761dca7751fe62c5349587481b96236f6492ba943cdc", "ja": "ああ。海美の公演の時、\n次のセンターをやりたがっていただろ？", "zh": "是这样的，之前海美在公演时，\n你不是说想担任下次的Center吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e9ebd32b35276b6982e1d5ae89977a0fb89452a77c2d4ab23b7d256b50eee085", "ja": "だから今度の公演は任せたいと思ってるんだけど、\nやってくれるか？", "zh": "所以我想把这次的公演交给你负责，\n你愿意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "519383aa7eb828688d5670bbe42f157cf7015d1d194f3c6c3dfd662cbc9a6282", "ja": "え……えええ～！？　あ、アタシがセンター！？\nい、いきなり、そんなこと言われても……。", "zh": "什……什么～！？要、要我来担任Center！？\n你、你问得也太突然了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f01be08dd335e2f6914e58ccd0dad8f5a6557af8d4df3da99215b761453c64ef", "ja": "なんだ、やりたかったんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "怎么了，你之前不是想要担任吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f4ef3f1a47696d6f4e85c10683f2f491d35a836a9d2ff4e0aeffa83ff6e6cc4a", "ja": "そうだけど……あのあと、海美の公演で頭が\nいっぱいでさ。すっかり忘れてたっていうか～。", "zh": "是没错啦……但在那之后，我满脑子都是海美的公演。\n怎么说呢，我完全忘了这件事～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "9d5816818fea5ec42b75be4aa647f2d71ab69b410290f9cbede2bb32ac4d1872", "ja": "ほ？　歩ちゃんは、センターやりたくないのです？", "zh": "哦？小步不想担任Center吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8adb80009f727a87b2dfef79edf8888443e70082cb0f278db66b22bf84547e22", "ja": "そういうわけじゃないよ！\nでも、心の準備ってものがさ～！", "zh": "不是这样啦！\n不过，要让人做好心理准备嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "83c98e863f49b2fa44345807bb99f095c9c270d9f83d6b832f66c86a04e8be6e", "ja": "歩ちゃん、この前の公演、\nとってもカッコよかったのです。", "zh": "小步，之前的公演，\n你表现得非常帅气的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "8a82f8afe5db361d3724e47534e6ca72f6782e5cfaeb8f5b331b8f78c9de926b", "ja": "だから次もきっと、ぱわほー！なステージを\n見せてくれると思うのです。", "zh": "所以下一次公演，\n你一定也能展现出震撼力强大的表演的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "207a9c151526aed086d25357673ad05f74aadf1543ad142cbc0c075e154675b7", "ja": "うん！　ファンのみんなも、\nアユムのダンス、楽しみにしてると思うヨ！", "zh": "没错！\n粉丝们一定也很期待看见步的舞蹈喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "2f329c549d8c673b1f6c2417c9450d7899c8eb78a0d92d4c1b9396ea4fd5e37b", "ja": "ワタシも、とっても楽しみだナ♪", "zh": "我也非常期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4b23d02820c116219d94da88aea5f418f0cb40a6778464d96b12ec086682d415", "ja": "ふたりとも……そ、そうだよな。\nファンのみんなの期待を、裏切ったらダメだよな！", "zh": "你们……也、也对，\n我不能辜负那些粉丝的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c3b0a33a51f25df70fff6897397478922fc0058269521d04209f43fe403abcff", "ja": "それじゃ歩、任せてもいいか？", "zh": "那么，步，我可以托付给你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bcce5d031183bf947d3db2ca938ddef11474580f571ca708df41b6dbde394da4", "ja": "う、うん、任せて！\nアタシ……頑張るよ！", "zh": "当、当然，交给我吧！\n我……会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_019_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_019_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8d2f7d0a3564e444f2e2df5d1868f1a995149a174c4027a2354d3c900d382c00", "ja": "（どうやら腹を括ったみたいだな。でも、まだ緊張が\n解けてない……しばらくは様子を見守るか）", "zh": "（看样子她已经下定决心了。\n但是，她依然相当紧张……暂时观望她的情况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
